   "text": "AudioWorklet mic \u2192 16 kHz PCM chunks\n24 kHz playback on a gapless timeline\nBarge-in stops the chunk that's playing\nScreen share + camera frames\nLive captions \u00b7 thinking / idle status\nVoice picker \u00b7 Deep-think toggle\nCitation chips in the transcript",
