   "text": "7 native views: grants \u00b7 detail \u00b7 stats \u00b7\ndeadlines \u00b7 agency \u00b7 eligibility \u00b7 draft\nA2UI v0.9 renderer + grants catalog\nBack / Forward / breadcrumbs (history)\nShortlist tray \u2192 compare, draft\nSources: card lines \u00b7 panel \u00b7 draft chips\nCard buttons send ui_action to the agent",
