   "text": "search_grants \u00b7 get_grant_detail \u00b7 get_grant_stats \u00b7 get_deadlines\nget_agency_overview \u00b7 get_eligible_grants \u00b7 google_search\ncompare_grants + compose_dashboard  \u2192  A2UI JSON\ndraft_grant_response  \u2192  streams 8 sections in the background\nsave / remove / show_shortlist \u00b7 remember_user_profile\nevery screen carries sources[]  (listing \u00b7 query \u00b7 your input \u00b7 AI)",
