   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\u2717 Not ADK: draft writer (8 parallel google-genai calls) \u00b7 ui_bus + SSE \u00b7 sources.py \u00b7 server.mjs proxy.     Not used yet: sub_agents / ParallelAgent / SequentialAgent \u00b7 adk eval \u00b7 Agent Engine \u00b7 adk web",
   "originalText": "\u2717 Not ADK: draft writer (8 parallel google-genai calls) \u00b7 ui_bus + SSE \u00b7 sources.py \u00b7 server.mjs proxy.     Not used yet: sub_agents / ParallelAgent / SequentialAgent \u00b7 adk eval \u00b7 Agent Engine \u00b7 adk web",
